<title>UK: M.Lynch makes Marks head of new Euro region.</title>
<headline>M.Lynch makes Marks head of new Euro region.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said on Thursday it had made Michael Marks, co-head of global equities and deputy chairman of Merrill Lynch International, chief operating officer of the Europe, Middle East and Africa region.</p>
<p>Marks' appointment is part of what Merrill called a &quot;realignment&quot; of its organisation &quot;designed to enhance services provided to a diverse global client base and position the company for the substantial worldwide growth opportunities in financial services&quot;.</p>
</text>
